    <string name="diag_how">Each probe page has bands. Draw one stroke in each with the pen, watching the display while you draw and after you lift, then answer for that band. Your answers go into Nib’s log, which you can share from About.</string>
    <string name="probe_match">Match preview</string>
    <string name="probe_match_help">Draw in each band at your usual pressure. If the display’s preview looked wider than the stroke that replaced it, lower that style’s size, and if it looked thinner, raise it. Then answer.</string>
