    <string name="probe_styles_help">Each band asks the display for one of its eight preview styles, in black at 4 px. Does the preview look like that style, and does it get replaced cleanly when you lift the pen?</string>
    <string name="probe_widths_help">Each band asks the display for a thin preview of a different width. Which widths does it draw as a clean, unbroken line?</string>
    <string name="probe_colours_help">Does the preview show in colour on this screen, and do the translucent ones break up?</string>
    <string name="probe_marker_colours_help">Each band uses the marker style at 16 px. On a Note Air6 C its half-transparent preview didn’t show most colours, so each band tries another way to send one. Which ones show while you draw?</string>
    <string name="probe_swap_help">Each band waits a different time before the swap, when the finished stroke replaces the display’s preview. Does any band flicker or flash then?</string>
